    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Vision problems can be avoided or readily treated through regular check-ups said experts on World Sight Day, October 14, at a seminar at the Aga Khan University Hospital. Raising awareness and educating people about issues which can lead to vision impairment is key to helping every person have a 'Right to Sight', the theme of this year's Day.",
